# Ensemble: docs/ensemble/merged_dossiers/ is THE entity source of record
# as of the chapter 59 release. Everything else under docs/ensemble/ is the
# machinery that produces it, and must stay out of the palace:
#   per_chapter/    1071 per-chapter JSON extraction intermediates
#   state_dossiers/  553 pre-merge, per-(type,subject) extractions that the
#                        merged_dossiers/ files supersede
#   *.json           merged.json alone is 7.7 MB of machine-readable facts
# Mining these once took the abyss wing from 136 to 13,577 drawers in the
# `general` room and pushed pipeline JSON above NPC dossiers on canon
# queries. Do not remove these four rules without re-running the sanity
# check in MEMPALACE_HORIZON.md.
